# Tests

- Locked items are listed in the [project guide](../../AGENTS.md). Do not change them to make a check pass.
- No rule may be weakened to make a test pass.
- When a check fails, fix the project so it meets the rule.
- Once the agreed questions and urgent words exist, the checks cover every question and every urgent word.
